  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/13877-1.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 113px;\" /><br /><br />The velocity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;just before the string is taut<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>gl</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn><mi>gl</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>gl</mi></msqrt><mo>=2</mo><msqrt><mi>gl</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />After the string is taut, both will move up with same speed, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>mv</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>gl</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />By this time centre of mass in at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>A further rise in the centre of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>gl</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence maximum height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
